35%。公司宣布2026财年将返还100万亿韩元股东回报，含30万亿韩元现金分红及60万亿韩元股份回购注销。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2299439","publishedAt":"2026-10-28T00:49:53.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"t40u3dw7a8lt5wq1p9rc5do5a"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/a192c125ac7c90e5e5369c2f6b25b235e5783c7c265d2b663f70de4fcda2fd35.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c25a33f3f3500a495dc69cede8cf4fc350b907af79fc24007e68e0819db0747e.webp 96w","itemId":"gtqmuhx06cft2pdedat95m33p","title":"Reddit股价暴跌30%：谷歌AI搜索冲击流量与用户增长","summary":"Reddit股价单日暴跌30.44%至90.15美元，财报显示第三季度收入增长53%至8.95亿美元，但用户日活仅增12%至1.303亿，低于分析师预期。CEO Huffman指出谷歌AI搜索功能导致每周超百万次推荐流量下降，若趋势持续第四季度日活或下降10%-20%。Reddit正通过强制登录减少依赖谷歌流量，并已与Google、OpenAI达成数据合作，但可能进一步影响用户访问。","sourceName":"Decrypt","sourceUrl":"https://decrypt.co/382276/reddit-stock-plunges-30-googles-ai-search","publishedAt":"2026-10-30T19:31:02.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"w405nw49gqzpom9c8gepfvnjc","title":"微软推出大规模自愿离职计划，削减成本聚焦AI","summary":"微软启动大规模自愿离职计划，针对约7%的美国员工，计划花费约9亿美元。该计划基于“规则70”，即员工年龄加上在微软的工作年限达到70或以上即可申请。符合条件的员工可获得8至39周的现金补偿，医疗和股票期权继续有效。微软计划在AI相关开发上投入1900亿美元。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/microsoft-voluntary-buyout-program-rule-of-70/","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T15:34:39.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":"u5fvhnnr0qhwqhsra3gkrbwod","title":"波音财报：737产能目标推迟至2027年，自由现金流指引下修至2029年","summary":"波音2026年Q3净亏损1.16亿美元，737产能目标推迟至2027年，自由现金流指引下修至2029年。商业航空板块营收同比下滑3%至107.2亿美元，运营亏损6.97亿美元；防务业务营收增长15%至79.4亿美元，运营利润率提升至6.2%。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3784606","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T22:16:21.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":"njl80opvmpjo97bnuh4uds5v1","title":"通用汽车将股票上市从纽交所转至纳斯达克","summary":"通用汽车计划从纽交所转移到纳斯达克全球精选市场上市，保留“GM”股票代码，此举表明其向科技公司转型。","sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-27/gm-to-move-stock-listing-to-tech-focused-nasdaq-leaving-nyse","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T10:45:04.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":"n0lpdg7e8c5ns873irw0wd2ts","title":"Meta宣布大规模增发融资计划，总额达950亿美元","summary":"Meta宣布启动约350亿美元的普通股和强制可转换优先股公开发行，并计划未来推出最高约600亿美元的场内股票发行计划，潜在融资规模合计达950亿美元。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2299004","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T12:37:04.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]}],"flashes":[],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalStories":20,"selectedCount":2155,"reportsCovered":7},"readingMinutes":6,"prev":"2026-W43","next":"2026-W45"}